@host = http://localhost:9764
@apiPrefix = /dbEngine
@contentType = application/json;charset=UTF-8
@acceptJson = application/json
@token = replace-with-your-token
@orderModel = ods_trade_order_sales_order
@orderId = 50001

### 基础 query.get：按虚拟主键查询订单
# 不声明 ext.fields / ext.relations，让服务按已发布目录返回主实体字段。
# 适合先确认当前 ods_trade_order_sales_order 的真实字段与是否存在 id=50001 的测试数据。
POST {{host}}{{apiPrefix}}/api/v1/query.get
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{acceptJson}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "manual: get test order",
  "model": "{{orderModel}}",
  "id": {{orderId}}
}
